    proxies:
      - '🇩🇪 DE | 🔴 | vless | @NamiraConfigs | 49'
      - '🇹🇷 TR | 🔴 | vless | @NamiraConfigs | 50'
      - '🇩🇪 DE | 🔴 | vless | @NamiraConfigs | 51'
